# Surfaces and epics

- Surface metadata: `features/<surface>/surface.js`
- Epic chips: `features/<surface>/epics.js`
- Stepper list: `features/<surface>/<epic>/screens.js`
- Wire new epics in `js/registry.js` (`EPIC_SCREENS`)
- Hash shape is `#/<surface>/<epic>/<screen>`
